  "sourceTitle": "Found a trajectory-shape entropy signal that predicts wrongness on Qwen3-4B-Instruct — and it transfers to unseen tasks",
  "sourceBodyHash": "598aee46d916a1c33c115ec81b8308dbff4e442912e95f4563c9d3a38643dd32",
